# 0004-project-zero-cloud-shadows.patch
# Cloud shadows (default ON) + deterministic cloud coverage generator. Applies onto
# the 0003-applied tree (0001 -> 0002 -> 0003 first): `git apply` from the repo root.
# CPU side is executed-and-proved here; GPU side is written blind against the applied
# tree and review-verified only — the user's first GPU build is its first execution.
# After applying, run: python3 Tools/GenerateCloudTextures.py --out
#   EngineContent/CelestialTextures/Clouds   (required: missing files = shadows off).

